(6288337, 930626, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. Not caring for the use of selective color on the flag, however. It draws my eye away from the real subject and point of the image, which is the gravestones.</td>', 'Nice. Not caring for the use of selective color on the flag, however. It draws my eye away from the real subject and point of the image, which is the gravestones.', '2011-01-19 12:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288339, 930165, 10785, '<td valign="top">Something about this makes it look as though it is rotated slightly to the left.</td>', 'Something about this makes it look as though it is rotated slightly to the left.', '2011-01-19 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288343, 930808, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the perspective.</td>', 'Nice job on the perspective.', '2011-01-19 12:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288344, 930790, 83313, '<td valign="top">What is 100 years old here? The idea mentioned in the title?</td>', 'What is 100 years old here? The idea mentioned in the title?', '2011-01-19 12:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288345, 930219, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. Great subject and composition.</td>', 'Very cool image. Great subject and composition.', '2011-01-19 12:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288347, 930476, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like that old Kodak building that I''ve seen in a few previous challenges.</td>', 'Looks like that old Kodak building that I''ve seen in a few previous challenges.', '2011-01-19 12:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288350, 930638, 10785, '<td valign="top">This needs a little unsharp mask applied, but I like the B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'This needs a little unsharp mask applied, but I like the B&W conversion.', '2011-01-19 12:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288351, 930258, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is nothing in this image that is physically 100 years old. Only a concept, and I would not have gotten that without the title.</td>', 'There is nothing in this image that is physically 100 years old. Only a concept, and I would not have gotten that without the title.', '2011-01-19 12:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288353, 930217, 10785, '<td valign="top">My personal interpretation of the challenge was to photograph something man made. I would accept a photo of a particular tree or a person or animal over 100 years would work, but this is a landscape photo and in my opinion doesn''t represent the challenge well.<br/> <br/>It is well done with the river providing a good leading line. Overall the photo is a little dark, but nicely exposed given the bright sky.</td>', 'My personal interpretation of the challenge was to photograph something man made. I would accept a photo of a particular tree or a person or animal over 100 years would work, but this is a landscape photo and in my opinion doesn''t represent the challenge well. It is well done with the river providing a good leading line. Overall the photo is a little dark, but nicely exposed given the bright sky.', '2011-01-19 13:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288354, 930734, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting yellow hue on this shot makes it look like something photographed in the ''70s.</td>', 'Interesting yellow hue on this shot makes it look like something photographed in the ''70s.', '2011-01-19 13:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288355, 930322, 10785, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool point of color! A little small but effective enough to draw the eye in. Overall the photo is a little grey in tone with no real deep blacks or whites.</td>', 'Pretty cool point of color! A little small but effective enough to draw the eye in. Overall the photo is a little grey in tone with no real deep blacks or whites.', '2011-01-19 13:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288356, 930707, 67258, '<td valign="top">A competent record shot, although there are some distracting light refections.  Artistically, you haven''t bought much to the subject, and I ind the photo rather dull.</td>', 'A competent record shot, although there are some distracting light refections.  Artistically, you haven''t bought much to the subject, and I ind the photo rather dull.', '2011-01-19 13:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288360, 930433, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well composed, good tonal range. A little dull, but nonetheless, pretty good.</td>', 'Well composed, good tonal range. A little dull, but nonetheless, pretty good.', '2011-01-19 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288361, 929914, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a great stein!  Photographically, a little dull - the composition and lighting are somewhat static and uninspiring.</td>', 'What a great stein!  Photographically, a little dull - the composition and lighting are somewhat static and uninspiring.', '2011-01-19 13:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288362, 930717, 67258, '<td valign="top">For me, there is a little too much foreground - I can see why you included it as the light tones balance out the composition, but for me it unbalances the perspective.  The processing is quite pretty, but I might prefer just a little more detail and texture.</td>', 'For me, there is a little too much foreground - I can see why you included it as the light tones balance out the composition, but for me it unbalances the perspective.  The processing is quite pretty, but I might prefer just a little more detail and texture.', '2011-01-19 13:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288363, 930709, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing composition and lighting - somewhat bothered by the apparent tilt.</td>', 'A pleasing composition and lighting - somewhat bothered by the apparent tilt.', '2011-01-19 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6288375, 930390, 99263, '<td valign="top">Wow! I would never have guessed that it''s 100 years old. I mean it looks so new like it was recently build. Really well preserved. Great image with wonderful contrasts and tones. Love the dramatic sky and wide angle view too.</td>', 'Wow! I would never have guessed that it''s 100 years old. I mean it looks so new like it was recently build. Really well preserved. Great image with wonderful contrasts and tones. Love the dramatic sky and wide angle view too.', '2011-01-19 13:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
