(6288688, 930630, 108069, '<td valign="top">I feel as though this composition is a little awkward, and while it is certainly meeting the age requirement, there''s not much more to the story. That said it''s technically great. Sharp, well lit, etc. I would have maybe angled for the date, the initials and the key in the lock. I think there''s a good story there.<br/> <br/>Not voting. Just saying the stupid stuff I see.</td>', 'I feel as though this composition is a little awkward, and while it is certainly meeting the age requirement, there''s not much more to the story. That said it''s technically great. Sharp, well lit, etc. I would have maybe angled for the date, the initials and the key in the lock. I think there''s a good story there. Not voting. Just saying the stupid stuff I see.', '2011-01-19 18:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
