(6288691, 930456, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome and moody. Perspective makes the viewer feel small and insignificant, which also adds to the mystery and power of longevity. Excellent.</td>', 'Awesome and moody. Perspective makes the viewer feel small and insignificant, which also adds to the mystery and power of longevity. Excellent.', '2011-01-19 18:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
