(6289415, 930802, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome tight focal plane. Right where it needs to be. Great composition along with some history and a story. Simple, elegant and meaningful. Excellent.</td>', 'Awesome tight focal plane. Right where it needs to be. Great composition along with some history and a story. Simple, elegant and meaningful. Excellent.', '2011-01-20 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6289416, 930809, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and range of tones. Nice story. Great subject.</td>', 'Great sharpness and range of tones. Nice story. Great subject.', '2011-01-20 14:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6289417, 930716, 108069, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the blur but it''s creating a bit of an optical illusion as to the straightness of the lighthouse. Very moody and wonderful tones and contrast. Great shot.</td>', 'I enjoy the blur but it''s creating a bit of an optical illusion as to the straightness of the lighthouse. Very moody and wonderful tones and contrast. Great shot.', '2011-01-20 14:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6289419, 930306, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wow, the stories those could tell. Excellent subject from an entirely different era. Great entry.</td>', 'Wow, the stories those could tell. Excellent subject from an entirely different era. Great entry.', '2011-01-20 14:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6289422, 930665, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome photograph. So crisp, and beautiful tones. Unbeatable perspective. I can hear the beams of light bending around that railing. Certainly one of my top for the challenge.</td>', 'Awesome photograph. So crisp, and beautiful tones. Unbeatable perspective. I can hear the beams of light bending around that railing. Certainly one of my top for the challenge.', '2011-01-20 14:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6289426, 930600, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great view. Nice cityscape. I think a levels adjustment to bring out the blacks a bit more would make this even better. Or more contrast in general, to make the light trails pop a bit (even though that''s not the subject). Regardless, excellent line into the photo and great motion. Very nice.</td>', 'Great view. Nice cityscape. I think a levels adjustment to bring out the blacks a bit more would make this even better. Or more contrast in general, to make the light trails pop a bit (even though that''s not the subject). Regardless, excellent line into the photo and great motion. Very nice.', '2011-01-20 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6289432, 930785, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great shot. For some reason it reminds me of a textbook photo going back 30 years or so, so the processing even reinforces the aged theme. Nice composition and a nicely conceived idea.</td>', 'Great shot. For some reason it reminds me of a textbook photo going back 30 years or so, so the processing even reinforces the aged theme. Nice composition and a nicely conceived idea.', '2011-01-20 14:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6289435, 930532, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great motion in the clouds and moon. Life goes on but the Hotel Europe remains. Reinforces the theme. I might have tried to play with the perspective in post processing to get rid of the angles, but then again that never works out that well (at least for me). Great entry.</td>', 'Great motion in the clouds and moon. Life goes on but the Hotel Europe remains. Reinforces the theme. I might have tried to play with the perspective in post processing to get rid of the angles, but then again that never works out that well (at least for me). Great entry.', '2011-01-20 14:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6289436, 930695, 108069, '<td valign="top">Spooky. Great mood, well lit to reveal all but without any unnatural shadows. I would like it bigger, but no real complaint. Nice composition. Good entry.</td>', 'Spooky. Great mood, well lit to reveal all but without any unnatural shadows. I would like it bigger, but no real complaint. Nice composition. Good entry.', '2011-01-20 14:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
