(6289606, 930473, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting old piece of equipment. IMO, the strong lighting in the background draws attention to the duller lighting on the base of the kiln that then fades to shade at the top. With such a large object, not sure there would be a whole bunch you could do about that, though. The rust patina, apparent lean, and slight tilt all support the shot very nicely.</td>', 'Interesting old piece of equipment. IMO, the strong lighting in the background draws attention to the duller lighting on the base of the kiln that then fades to shade at the top. With such a large object, not sure there would be a whole bunch you could do about that, though. The rust patina, apparent lean, and slight tilt all support the shot very nicely.', '2011-01-20 18:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
