(6289893, 930403, 113419, '<td valign="top">There is one of these close to where I work and I''ve tired to capture it a few times....but it is abandoned out in a fence row, lots of brush, etc.  Rusty - no paint....makes it hard to photograph.  I found it in the fall so it blended in with everything.  Went back in the snow and even though the capture was better still not what I want.  Would probably be better if I could climb the fence and get it at a different angle but there are no tresspassing signs everywhere.  Aw well....anyway I like your photo very much and think that you''ve done a wonderful job with it.</td>', 'There is one of these close to where I work and I''ve tired to capture it a few times....but it is abandoned out in a fence row, lots of brush, etc.  Rusty - no paint....makes it hard to photograph.  I found it in the fall so it blended in with everything.  Went back in the snow and even though the capture was better still not what I want.  Would probably be better if I could climb the fence and get it at a different angle but there are no tresspassing signs everywhere.  Aw well....anyway I like your photo very much and think that you''ve done a wonderful job with it.', '2011-01-21 07:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
