(6290584, 930600, 101702, '<td valign="top">Whilst the city itself might be 100 years old, I''m not seeing anything specific that is 100 years old. The buildings all look like modern skyscrapers, the road is tarmac, even the trees are young so I''m just not getting it, sorry.</td>', 'Whilst the city itself might be 100 years old, I''m not seeing anything specific that is 100 years old. The buildings all look like modern skyscrapers, the road is tarmac, even the trees are young so I''m just not getting it, sorry.', '2011-01-22 06:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
