(6290874, 930095, 30861, '<td valign="top">Interestingly, by definition a "cart" has 2 wheels, and a "wagon" 4 wheels... I just found that out as I was trying to get a name for a particular wagon I found near here. <br/> <br/>Regardless, a nice shot. The title is not affecting the score I give. Just thought I''d share what I had found :-)</td>', 'Interestingly, by definition a "cart" has 2 wheels, and a "wagon" 4 wheels... I just found that out as I was trying to get a name for a particular wagon I found near here.  Regardless, a nice shot. The title is not affecting the score I give. Just thought I''d share what I had found :-)', '2011-01-22 15:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
