(6293205, 930499, 124982, '<td valign="top">One of the few 8''s I gave in this challenge...just love the composition and PP used to give it this eery, dark vibe. Really a beautiful picture!</td>', 'One of the few 8''s I gave in this challenge...just love the composition and PP used to give it this eery, dark vibe. Really a beautiful picture!', '2011-01-24 22:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293302, 930711, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Just a heads up as to how we can tell the moon is fake, for future reference (not sure if you''re even allowed to add the moon, but...) - you can tell it''s a wide angle shot because of the distortion on the castle, so the moon would be 1/100th the size it is in the picture.  You can also tell it had a long shutter speed because of the star movement in the top-left.  SO, the moon would be totally blown out / blurry if it was shot at the same time as the scenery.<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>Awesome scene though!  I dig it.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Just a heads up as to how we can tell the moon is fake, for future reference (not sure if you''re even allowed to add the moon, but...) - you can tell it''s a wide angle shot because of the distortion on the castle, so the moon would be 1/100th the size it is in the picture.  You can also tell it had a long shutter speed because of the star movement in the top-left.  SO, the moon would be totally blown out / blurry if it was shot at the same time as the scenery. :) Awesome scene though!  I dig it.', '2011-01-25 00:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6293303, 930747, 38930, '<td valign="top">Very awesome!  This isn''t a side of Big Ben you see too often.</td>', 'Very awesome!  This isn''t a side of Big Ben you see too often.', '2011-01-25 00:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
