(6294511, 930040, 125031, '<td valign="top">Very nice! As soon as I heard about the challenge, I thought of a shot nearly identical to that one (your background is much nicer though). I had seen a piece of a rail with a date of 1900 on it, and it looked really nice in the morning light. Unfortunately, it was in an oil refinery where cameras are prohibited. <br/> <br/>Glad to see somebody else was able to pull off the shot I''d visualized, and did well with it, congrats!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-26 01:58:36.</i></td>', 'Very nice! As soon as I heard about the challenge, I thought of a shot nearly identical to that one (your background is much nicer though). I had seen a piece of a rail with a date of 1900 on it, and it looked really nice in the morning light. Unfortunately, it was in an oil refinery where cameras are prohibited.  Glad to see somebody else was able to pull off the shot I''d visualized, and did well with it, congrats!', '2011-01-26 01:57:30.000000', '2011-01-26 01:58:36.000000', 0),
(6294516, 930790, 30982, '<td valign="top">Made me think of that Heath Ledger movie where they put the Nike swoosh on armor or something.  My mind is a rusty sieve...  Anyway, congrats on the nifty non-official but still quite entertaining ribbon!  :-)</td>', 'Made me think of that Heath Ledger movie where they put the Nike swoosh on armor or something.  My mind is a rusty sieve...  Anyway, congrats on the nifty non-official but still quite entertaining ribbon!  :-)', '2011-01-26 02:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
