(6294549, 930461, 126233, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the positive comments everyone! <br/>Just to clarify, the picture was not taken off the challenge period! And it was chosen with the objective of entering the contest, however, since I''m a little bit distracted, I set the date year to 2010 instead of 2011 when I bought the camera, earlier this month! :S<br/> <br/>I appealed to the site council, however for them it seems to be possible to take a picture with a camera that does not exist at the time! :P<br/> <br/>Well, anyways, thank you all for the appreciation!</td>', 'Thank you for all the positive comments everyone! Just to clarify, the picture was not taken off the challenge period! And it was chosen with the objective of entering the contest, however, since I''m a little bit distracted, I set the date year to 2010 instead of 2011 when I bought the camera, earlier this month! :S I appealed to the site council, however for them it seems to be possible to take a picture with a camera that does not exist at the time! :P Well, anyways, thank you all for the appreciation!', '2011-01-26 03:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
