(6331023, 930293, 66384, '<td valign="top">Not sure why the "inspirational shot" scored so much better than this one. <b>I much prefer the warmth in your shot</b>. The other seems to have an overall cold blue tinge. The other one is a bit crisper and has a nicer sky -- the little cloud in your shot is a bit of a distraction. But <b>I really like the texture and detail in yours</b>. I also think the voters in 2002 were kinder than they are now. Interesting that that photographer only entered two challenges and hasn''t participated in any way since 2002.</td>', 'Not sure why the "inspirational shot" scored so much better than this one. I much prefer the warmth in your shot. The other seems to have an overall cold blue tinge. The other one is a bit crisper and has a nicer sky -- the little cloud in your shot is a bit of a distraction. But I really like the texture and detail in yours. I also think the voters in 2002 were kinder than they are now. Interesting that that photographer only entered two challenges and hasn''t participated in any way since 2002.', '2011-02-24 14:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
